{"articleNo":"1422","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1422&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"Hot)2010 금오공대 취업EXPO개최 및 취업골든벨 참가자 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.10.08","hit":"11579","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><font size=\"6\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 2010 금오공대 취업</font><font color=\"#ff00ff\">E</font><font color=\"#ff9900\">X</font><font color=\"#00ff00\">P</font><font color=\"#3366ff\">O</font><font color=\"#0000ff\"> 개최<br><br></font></font></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\"><strong>□</strong> <strong>행사목적 :</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\"> 취업준비생들의 취업역량강화와 취업경쟁력 고취<br></font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><strong>□</strong> <strong>행사일정 :</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><strong> <font color=\"#0000ff\">2010. 10. 13(수) 금오광장</font></strong></span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><strong><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></strong></span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><strong>□</strong> <strong>참가대상 :</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 전교생 누구나<br></span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><strong>□</strong> <strong>주요행사 :</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;취업 및 진로정보 총망라&nbsp;[26개 영역]<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 삼성 / LG / 포스코 / STX그룹 (취업선배님과의 만남)<br></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\"><strong>□ 부대행사<br></strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>- 취업골든벨대회</strong></font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">(오후 1시에&nbsp;대회시작).....</font><font color=\"#993300\"><font size=\"4\">TV방송촬영예정</font><br></font></strong>&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>- 경품추첨</strong></font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>(오후 2시에 경품추첨)<br></strong></font></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>- 입사서류경진대회</strong></font> <font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>(오후 4시에 경품시상)</strong></font><br><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 가지,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffcc00\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\"><font color=\"#000000\">취</font><font color=\"#ff6600\">업</font><font color=\"#00ff00\">골</font><font color=\"#ff00ff\">든</font><font color=\"#800080\">벨</font> <font color=\"#ff00ff\">참</font><font color=\"#993300\">가</font><font color=\"#0000ff\">신</font>청 :</font></font> <font color=\"#0000ff\"><font size=\"4\">취업정보센터</font><font size=\"2\">(도서관 210호)</font></font><font color=\"#0000ff\"><u><br></u></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 가지,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffcc00\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\"><font color=\"#000000\">취</font><font color=\"#ff6600\">업</font><font color=\"#00ff00\">골</font><font color=\"#ff00ff\">든</font><font color=\"#800080\">벨</font> <font color=\"#ff00ff\">참</font><font color=\"#993300\">가</font><font color=\"#0000ff\">신</font>청 :</font></font> <font color=\"#0000ff\"><font size=\"4\">취업정보센터</font><font size=\"2\">(도서관 210호)</font></font></span><br></font></span><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font><strong><font color=\"#800000\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://kumoh.ac.kr/FCKeditor/editor/images/smiley/msn/heart.gif\">&nbsp;취업골든벨대회 참가자에 한해 필요시 ’확인서’ 발급해드립니다.<br></font></strong><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span></font></p><hr></font></span><p></p><font size=\"3\">\n<p></p>\n</font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\"><strong><font size=\"5\">&lt;취업<font color=\"#ff00ff\">E</font><font color=\"#ff9900\">X</font><font color=\"#00ff00\">P</font><font color=\"#3366ff\">O</font> </font></strong><strong><font size=\"5\"><font face=\"Verdana\">왕대박</font> 경품&gt;</font><br></strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\"><br><font face=\"Comic Sans MS\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\"><strong>총장님께서</strong></font> 취업준비로 고생하는 금오공대 후배들을 격려하기 위해&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 610만원 상당의 경품을 준비하셨습니다.&nbsp;<br></font><br>&nbsp;<strong>» 참가자&nbsp;전원 :</strong> <font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>디렉토리북, 볼펜, 취업종합가이드, 우유, 빵 <font color=\"#ff0000\" size=\"4\">증정</font><br></strong></font></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\"><br>&nbsp;<strong>»&nbsp;경품내역&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong><font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>삼성넷북&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 50만원&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 아이리버전자사전&nbsp; &nbsp;30만원&nbsp; &nbsp; 4명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 고급자전거&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 20만원&nbsp; &nbsp; 9명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; USB메모리&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3만원 &nbsp; 10명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;문화상품권&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 10만원&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 5명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 문화상품권&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5만원&nbsp; &nbsp;10명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 문화상품권&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2만원&nbsp; &nbsp;29명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 문화상품권&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1만원&nbsp; &nbsp;22명&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></strong></font><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://kumoh.ac.kr/FCKeditor/editor/images/smiley/msn/regular_smile.gif\">&nbsp; <font color=\"#ff0000\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>총 <font size=\"5\">91명</font> 에게 <font size=\"5\">610만원상당</font>의 현물지급</strong></font><br></font><br><hr></font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><strong><font size=\"5\">&lt;경품타기 위한 3가지 방법&gt;<br></font></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\"><br>&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff00ff\"><strong> 1.</strong></font><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\"><strong> 취업골든벨대회 참가하기</strong></font></font></font><font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong><font size=\"2\">(취업정보센터 방문 참가신청 접수).....</font><font color=\"#ff0000\" size=\"2\"><font size=\"4\">TV방송 촬영예정</font>&nbsp;<br></font></strong><br></font><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#ff9900\"><strong>2. 입사서류경진대회 참가하기</strong></font></font><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>(’20관 Best입사서류클리닉’에 이력서/자소서 제출)<br></strong></font><br>&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#339966\">3.</font></strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font color=\"#339966\" size=\"2\"><strong> 경품추첨에 참가하여&nbsp;경품타기</strong></font><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>(리플렛에 확인싸인 5개 이상 받아야 함)&nbsp;<br></strong></font><br><br><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://kumoh.ac.kr/FCKeditor/editor/images/smiley/msn/regular_smile.gif\">취업골든벨에 참가해 TV에 나오고 경품도 받고~ :&nbsp;</font><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\">취업정보센터 <font size=\"3\"><strong>신청접수 중</strong></font>(선착 150명)<br></font><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://kumoh.ac.kr/FCKeditor/editor/images/smiley/msn/regular_smile.gif\">입사서류 클리닉도 받고 경품도 타고~&nbsp; :&nbsp;</font><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#ff6600\">’20관 Best입사서류클리닉’방문하여 이력서/자소서 제출<br></font><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://kumoh.ac.kr/FCKeditor/editor/images/smiley/msn/regular_smile.gif\">취업 &amp; 진로상담도 받고 경품도 타고~&nbsp;&nbsp;: <font color=\"#339966\">5개이상 확인싸인이 없으면 당첨되어도 경품지급 불가</font>&nbsp;<br><br><br><font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>타대학교에서 참가한 학생들은&nbsp;경품지급 불가합니다.<br>리플렛 오른쪽하단의 참가번호를 반드시 경품추첨함에&nbsp;넣어주셔야 합니다.<br>리플렛에 5개이상 확인싸인을 받지못한&nbsp;후배님은&nbsp;경품당첨되어도 경품을 받을 수 없습니다.</strong></font><br><br><hr></font></span><strong><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 총장님께서 직접 경품 지급합니다.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 문의처 : 취업정보센터 (478-7210~2)</font></strong></span></font>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
